<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61490" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾰγᾰρίζομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, dub. sens., <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>V.</u>
			674
		</span></i>
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ κηθαρίου λαγαριζόμενον</span>, expld. by
		Sch. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ λαγαρὰ ἐσθίοντα, ὅ ἐστιν
			εὔθραυστα καὶ εὐτελῆ τινα</span>, i.e. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>getting a poor living</i> out of the
			ballot-box. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> prob.
				<i>scrape</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				121
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>jog</i> or <i>nudge with the elbow</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαλεύειν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαγαρυζόμενον</span>
			 in Ar.l.c., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαγυριζόμενοι</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
			</span></i> l.c.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>B.</b> intr.
			in 
				Act.
			, of the pulse, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.662
			</span></i>.</div>
